{"id":"a57a1e194dcbcdea","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-dependent-pair-per.md","title":"依赖对关系的 PER 性及常纤维退化","display":"thm-dependent-pair-per — 依赖对关系的 PER 性及常纤维退化","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-dependent-pair-per","aliases":["72-thm-dependent-pair-per"],"display":"thm-dependent-pair-per — 依赖对关系的 PER 性及常纤维退化","depends_on":["[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]]","[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§3.7,3.9, print743–744,746/PDF755–756,758; local PER proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-dependent-pair-per"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-dependent-pair-per</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-pair-per — 依赖对关系的 PER 性及常纤维退化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" href=\"?note=5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" title=\"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per\">72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9c13fa158735675\" href=\"?note=b9c13fa158735675\" title=\"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift\">72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§3.7,3.9, print743–744,746/PDF755–756,758; local PER proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>参数及类上不变性取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" href=\"?note=5b28d334ba6b8ce1\" title=\"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per\">72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_\\beta:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\">\\(\\Phi_\\beta:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi_\\beta)=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi_\\beta)=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对称性先交换 α 相关的两个第一分量，类上不变性把 Φ(a) 换成 Φ(a′)，再用纤维对称性。传递性中间 pair 的分解唯一，把两个纤维统一后用其传递性。扩张由上游提升定理。常纤维时两个规范 pair 关系逐元素完全相等，故其预求值扩张相等；空支撑也成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift","status":"resolved","id":"b9c13fa158735675","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-thm-preevaluation-per-lift]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per","status":"resolved","id":"5b28d334ba6b8ce1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"参数及类上不变性取 [[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]]；$\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，$\\Phi_\\beta:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_\\beta:=\\{\\langle a,\\beta\\rangle:a\\in|\\alpha|\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q^\\Sigma_{\\alpha,\\Phi}\\in\\operatorname{PER}(T),\\qquad\n\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi_\\beta)=\\alpha\\otimes_{\\mathfrak e}\\beta.","display":true}],"bytes":1618,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-204","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-574","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增8项：[[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] · [[72-df-disjoint-sum-membership-per]] · [[72-df-natural-number-membership-per]] · [[72-ex-function-per-domain-antitonicity]] · [[72-thm-dependent-function-quotient-action]] · [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]] · [[72-thm-natural-number-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-product-per-quotient]]"},{"id":"a2a2a019192aaa2c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\alpha,\\Phi,\\operatorname{pair}$ 取 [[72-df-dependent-pair-membership-per]] 的全部结构条件；PER 性取 [[72-thm-dependent-pair-per]]。$R:=\\Sigma_{\\mathfrak e}(\\alpha,\\Phi)$；纤维满足 $a\\alpha a'\\Rightarrow\\Phi(a)=\\Phi(a')$。$B_\\Phi,q_\\Sigma$ 在下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["5b28d334ba6b8ce1","b9c13fa158735675"]}